e biopsy cavity are submitted in C and H  unremarkable breast parenchyma in I and skin with scar in J  Labeled  left axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 2cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is sectioned to reveal multiple lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE m to 0 4cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are submitted in K P  Resident  Ross C  Wheeler  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART A  BREAST MASS  LEFT  PART B  AUXILLARY CONTENTS  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
