lky substance located 1 4cm to the lateral aspect of the biopsy cavity  The closest one is 1 0cm from the posterior margin  No masses are identified  The uninvolved parenchyma is composed primarily of yellow and red  lobulated fibroadipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A D  biopsy cavity entirely submitted  including closest surgical margin  E F  Duct like structures  lateral to biopsy cavity  G J  Additional representative sections of parenchyma surrounding biopsy cavity site  Resident  TRACY L  DAVIS  MD   Ph D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
