proval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  13 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 10 07 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast lumpectomy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm yellow tan fibroadipose tissue  Two sutures are present which are designated as short stitch superior and long stitch lateral  The specimen is oriented and inked as follows  anterior   blue  deep margin black  lateral red  and medial yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from superior to inferior  A REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm white firm mass including surrounding fibrosis is identified 2 0cm from the superior surface  The tumor extends to the blue inked anterior surface and inferior deep edge  The specimen is submitted from superior to inferior sections in cassettes A Q  Cross sections are bisected and submitted in C N  The last cross section is radially sectioned and submitted in cassettes O Q denoting the inferior deep margin  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shave margins inferior half of cavity   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm yellow tan fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is unoriented  Specimen is serially sectioned and submitted in cassettes R T  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  superior half of cavity  final shaved margins   are six yellow tan fibroadipose tissue fragments measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  Fragments are unoriented  The segments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes U W  Resident  CHAD SOUPIR  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  John A Foster  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  LEFT INFE